Package: arm-linux-uclibc
Architecture: any
Section: devel
Priority: extra
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, gcc-arm-linux-uclibc
Description: The uClibc library (compiled for ARM)
 This is the replacement for the system libc library specially tuned
 for size.  This package is needed for anyone developing applications
 for uClinux on ARM.
